-- title:
--   Element of reduced norm ℓ in R[1/r], unit away from ℓ
-- statement:
--   Let $a,b\in\mathbb Q$ and let $q$ be a prime with $q\neq 2$ such that $\mathbb H=\left(\frac{a,b}{\mathbb Q}\right)$ satisfies `IsDefiniteRamifiedExactlyAt a b q`, i.e. $a<0$, $b<0$, and for every height-one prime $w$ of $\mathcal O_{\mathbb Q}$ the algebra $\mathbb H\otimes_{\mathbb Q}\mathbb Q_w$ has all nonzero elements invertible exactly when $q\in w$. Let $R$ be a $\mathbb Z$-submodule of $\mathbb H$ which is an Eichler order of level $N$, that is, $R=\Lambda_1\cap\Lambda_2$ for maximal orders $\Lambda_1,\Lambda_2$ with the index of $R$ in $\Lambda_1$ (as additive subgroups) equal to $N$. Let $r$ be a prime with $r\neq q$, let $v$ be a height-one prime containing $r$, and let $\ell$ be a prime with $\ell\neq q$ and $\ell\nmid N$. Then there exists a unit $s\in\mathbb H^\times$ such that: for every height-one prime $w\neq v$, the image $s\otimes 1$ of $s$ in $\mathbb H\otimes_{\mathbb Q}\mathbb Q_w$ lies in the local box of $R$ at $w$, the additive subgroup generated by the elements $z\otimes c$ with $z\in R$ and $c$ an integer of $\mathbb Q_w$; for every such $w$ with moreover $\ell\notin w$, both $s\otimes 1$ and the inverse of the corresponding local unit lie in that local box; and $\mathrm{nrd}(s)=s_{\mathrm{re}}^2-a\,s_{\mathrm{imI}}^2-b\,s_{\mathrm{imJ}}^2+ab\,s_{\mathrm{imK}}^2$ equals $\ell$.
--
--   This is the combination of the Hasse–Schilling–Eichler norm theorem with strong approximation for the norm-one group away from the place $v$ above the split prime $r$: the $S$-arithmetic order $R[1/r]$ contains an element of reduced norm exactly $\ell$ which is a local unit at all places other than $v$ and those dividing $\ell$. It supplies global representatives for the Hecke correspondence at $\ell$ on the coset graph of the Čerednik–Drinfeld description, and is used in [`CerednikDrinfeld.exists_units_finiteIdele_primeHeckeSet_meetOrder_eq_tmul_one_of_not_dvd`](thm.html#CerednikDrinfeld.exists_units_finiteIdele_primeHeckeSet_meetOrder_eq_tmul_one_of_not_dvd).
