--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_CerednikDrinfeld_CosetGraph_exists_units_nrd_eq_prime_forall_mem_localBox.lean

